{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24550","headline":"百日假满少傅官停自喜言怀 · 白居易","name":"百日假满少傅官停自喜言怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长告今朝满十旬，从兹萧洒便终身。\n老嫌手重抛牙笏，病喜头轻换角巾。\n疎傅不朝悬组绶，尚平无累毕婚姻。\n人言世事何时了，我是人间事了人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24550.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24550","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}